# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Investments
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

$WIP
DataType InvestmentMode
Description What to do with twenty years of trades in an investment account.
Details Replay is the default because the income it posts belongs in a report
Details of income. PositionsOnly exists because an account whose history is
Details not wanted is common, and because the balance is what matters here.
Examples: EnumerationValues
| Value         | Notes                                                        |
| CashOnly      | This round: only records that move cash out of the account   |
| Replay        | Every action is imported, in order                           |
| PositionsOnly | Only the resulting holdings, established at the last price   |

$WIP
DataType QifAction
Description The N field of an investment record.
Examples: EnumerationValues
| Value     | Notes                                         |
| Buy       | Cash to shares                                |
| BuyX      | Same, with the cash from another account      |
| Sell      | Shares to cash                                |
| SellX     | Same, with the cash to another account        |
| Div       | A cash dividend                               |
| DivX      | Same, paid into another account               |
| IntInc    | Interest                                      |
| CGLong    | A long-term capital gain distribution         |
| CGShort   | A short-term capital gain distribution        |
| ReinvDiv  | A dividend reinvested                         |
| ReinvInt  | Interest reinvested                           |
| ReinvLg   | A long gain distribution reinvested           |
| ReinvSh   | A short gain distribution reinvested          |
| ShrsIn    | Shares added with no cash                     |
| ShrsOut   | Shares removed with no cash                   |
| StkSplit  | A share count change at no value              |
| MargInt   | Margin interest paid                          |
| MiscExp   | A miscellaneous expense                       |
| MiscInc   | Miscellaneous income                          |
| XIn       | Cash in from another account                  |
| XOut      | Cash out to another account                   |
| Unsupported | Anything else; reported, not imported       |

$WIP
BusinessRule What each investment action posts
Description In the terms of Investments: a holding is an account carrying a money
Description balance, income goes to an Income category, and anything that is only
Description a change in market value goes to Equity:Market Value Changes.
Examples: ActionPosting
| Action   | Debited                  | Credited                    | Notes                             |
| Buy      | The holding account      | The cash account            | Commission to Expenses:Investment:Fees |
| BuyX     | The holding account      | The transfer account        |                                   |
| Sell     | The cash account         | The holding account         | Any excess to Equity:Market Value Changes |
| SellX    | The transfer account     | The holding account         |                                   |
| Div      | The cash account         | Income:Dividends            |                                   |
| DivX     | The transfer account     | Income:Dividends            |                                   |
| IntInc   | The cash account         | Income:Interest             |                                   |
| CGLong   | The cash account         | Income:Capital Gains:Long   |                                   |
| CGShort  | The cash account         | Income:Capital Gains:Short  |                                   |
| ReinvDiv | The holding account      | Income:Dividends            | No cash moves                     |
| ReinvInt | The holding account      | Income:Interest             |                                   |
| ReinvLg  | The holding account      | Income:Capital Gains:Long   |                                   |
| ReinvSh  | The holding account      | Income:Capital Gains:Short  |                                   |
| ShrsIn   | The holding account      | Equity:Opening Balances     | Shares from before the file       |
| ShrsOut  | Equity:Opening Balances  | The holding account         |                                   |
| StkSplit | Nothing                  | Nothing                     | Shares and price change, value does not |
| MargInt  | Expenses:Investment:Interest | The cash account        |                                   |
| MiscExp  | The category named       | The cash account            |                                   |
| MiscInc  | The cash account         | The category named          |                                   |
| XIn      | The cash account         | The transfer account        |                                   |
| XOut     | The transfer account     | The cash account            |                                   |

Attributes ActionPosting
| Attribute | Type   | Default |
| Action    | String |         |
| Debited   | String |         |
| Credited  | String |         |
| Notes     | String | none    |

$WIP
