Scenario A stock split changes the shares and the price but posts nothing
Description The value of the holding is the same before and after, so there is
Description nothing to post, and posting a revaluation of zero would clutter
Description the register. The Q field holds the number of new shares for each
Description old one, multiplied by ten, which is Quicken's own convention.
