When qif file imported
Then postings are : PostingRow
| Ref | Date       | Payee    | Account                  | Amount   | Memo | Cleared   |
| T1  | 2025-11-15 | A Client | Assets:Customer Invoices | 2500.00  | none | Cleared   |
| T1  | 2025-11-15 | A Client | Income:Consulting        | -2500.00 | none | Uncleared |
# Raw postings, so the income line is negative and the two sum to zero. A reader
# never sees that sign: the display sign of an income account is -1, so the
# report shows 2500.00 of income. See the display sign rule in Accounts.

