Scenario No statement balance means the import cannot check itself
Description The account blocks in these files carry a name, a type and
Description sometimes a credit limit, and never a statement balance. So the
Description check that ImportOfx makes against a downloaded ledger balance has
Description nothing to compare with, and the migration says so rather than
Description reporting that everything agreed.
Given the file contains
"""
!Option:AutoSwitch
!Account
NChecking
TBank
^
"""
When qif file imported
Then balance check is : LedgerBalanceResult Vertical
| ClearedBalance | 0.00  |
| StatedBal      | 0.00  |
| Difference     | 0.00  |
| Agrees         | false |
Then migration notes are : MigrationNote
| Kind            | Detail                                                      |
| NoStatedBalance | No account block carries a statement balance; the import was not checked against one |

